#: ui.rank.dialog_title
msgctxt "ui.rank.dialog_title"
msgid "全球排名"
msgstr "Global ranking"

#: ui.rank.consent
msgctxt "ui.rank.consent"
msgid ""
    "开启后，每局清台时会向排名服务器提交：\n"
    "  • 本局用时、图标数量、击球次数\n"
    "  • 一个匿名设备标识（由本机系统 ID 加盐哈希得到，无法还原）\n"
    "\n"
    "不会上传图标名称、桌面截图或任何个人文件信息。可随时在主窗口关闭。\n"
    "\n"
    "是否开启全球排名？"
msgstr ""
    "When this is on, every cleared round sends the following to the ranking server:\n"
    "  • round time, icon count and shot count\n"
    "  • an anonymous device id (a salted hash of your system id, which cannot be reversed)\n"
    "\n"
    "Icon names, desktop screenshots and personal files are never uploaded. You can turn it off in the main window at any time.\n"
    "\n"
    "Turn on global ranking?"

#: ui.rank.intro
msgctxt "ui.rank.intro"
msgid ""
    "现在可以和全球玩家比谁清台更快了。\n"
    "\n"
    "{consent}"
msgstr ""
    "Now you can race players around the world at clearing the table.\n"
    "\n"
    "{consent}"

