#: shell.error.no_desktop
msgctxt "shell.error.no_desktop"
msgid "暂时无法连接 Windows 桌面。请等待桌面加载完成后重试；如果使用了桌面替代软件，请先恢复 Windows 桌面。"
msgstr "Cannot reach the Windows desktop yet. Wait for it to finish loading and try again; if you use a desktop replacement, restore the real Windows desktop first."

#: shell.error.pending_recovery
msgctxt "shell.error.pending_recovery"
msgid "有未完成的桌面布局恢复记录，请先点“恢复原位置”。"
msgstr "A desktop layout restore is still pending. Click \"Restore original positions\" first."

#: shell.error.no_icons
msgctxt "shell.error.no_icons"
msgid "没有找到真实桌面图标；请确认Explorer桌面已启用。"
msgstr "No real desktop icons were found; check that the Explorer desktop is enabled."

#: shell.error.snap_failed
msgctxt "shell.error.snap_failed"
msgid "无法暂时关闭图标自动排列/网格对齐。"
msgstr "Icon auto-arrange / grid alignment could not be turned off."

#: shell.error.monitor_changed
msgctxt "shell.error.monitor_changed"
msgid "显示器布局或分辨率已变化；已暂停，布局快照保留。"
msgstr "The monitor layout or resolution changed; the round is paused and its layout snapshot kept."

#: shell.error.monitor_changed_keep
msgctxt "shell.error.monitor_changed_keep"
msgid "显示器布局已变化，保留原快照；请恢复显示器配置后再恢复图标。"
msgstr "The monitor layout changed and the original snapshot is kept. Restore your display setup, then restore the icons."

#: shell.error.restore_incomplete
msgctxt "shell.error.restore_incomplete"
msgid "桌面位置未完全恢复；快照仍保留，请重试恢复。"
msgstr "The desktop positions were not fully restored; the snapshot is kept — try restoring again."

#: shell.error.flags_incomplete
msgctxt "shell.error.flags_incomplete"
msgid "排列设置未完全恢复；快照仍保留。"
msgstr "The arrangement settings were not fully restored; the snapshot is kept."

#: shell.error.desktop_changed
msgctxt "shell.error.desktop_changed"
msgid "Windows 桌面在连接过程中发生变化，请重新启动游戏。"
msgstr "The Windows desktop changed while connecting. Please start the game again."

#: shell.error.no_view
msgctxt "shell.error.no_view"
msgid "Windows 未返回可用的桌面视图，请等待桌面加载完成后重试。"
msgstr "Windows did not return a usable desktop view. Wait for the desktop to finish loading and try again."

#: overlay.error.no_desktop_window
msgctxt "overlay.error.no_desktop_window"
msgid "找不到 Windows 桌面窗口，请等待桌面加载完成后重试。"
msgstr "The Windows desktop window was not found. Wait for it to finish loading and try again."

#: overlay.error.no_listview
msgctxt "overlay.error.no_listview"
msgid "找不到覆盖主屏幕的 Explorer 桌面图标窗口，请确认 Windows 桌面已加载。"
msgstr "The Explorer desktop icon window that covers the main screen was not found. Check that the Windows desktop has loaded."

#: overlay.error.bounds_failed
msgctxt "overlay.error.bounds_failed"
msgid "读取桌面图标位置失败（{operation}，Windows 错误 {code}）。"
msgstr "Could not read the desktop icon positions ({operation}, Windows error {code})."

#: overlay.error.bounds_denied
msgctxt "overlay.error.bounds_denied"
msgid "Windows 拒绝访问桌面进程，请确认游戏与桌面在同一登录会话运行，并检查安全软件的拦截记录。"
msgstr " Windows denied access to the desktop process. Check that the game and the desktop run in the same login session, and check your security software log."

#: overlay.error.not_covering
msgctxt "overlay.error.not_covering"
msgid "桌面绘制窗口未覆盖主屏幕，已保留原桌面图标。"
msgstr "The drawing window does not cover the main screen, so the original desktop icons were kept."

#: overlay.error.icons_hidden
msgctxt "overlay.error.icons_hidden"
msgid "桌面图标当前已隐藏，请先在桌面菜单中显示图标。"
msgstr "Desktop icons are hidden right now. Show them from the desktop menu first."

#: overlay.error.no_icons
msgctxt "overlay.error.no_icons"
msgid "没有获取到图标。请确认桌面上有可用图标，且桌面图标已显示。"
msgstr "No icons were read. Check that the desktop has usable icons and that desktop icons are shown."

#: overlay.error.empty_icon
msgctxt "overlay.error.empty_icon"
msgid "系统返回了空图标"
msgstr "Windows returned an empty icon"

#: overlay.error.geometry_changed
msgctxt "overlay.error.geometry_changed"
msgid "显示器布局变化，已停止台球并恢复桌面"
msgstr "The monitor layout changed; the table stopped and the desktop was restored"

#: overlay.error.monitors_changed
msgctxt "overlay.error.monitors_changed"
msgid "屏幕布局或 DPI 缩放变化，已恢复桌面，请重新开始。"
msgstr "The screen layout or DPI scaling changed; the desktop was restored — please start again."

#: paths.error.no_directory
msgctxt "paths.error.no_directory"
msgid "找不到可写入的运行目录（临时目录和用户目录都不可用）"
msgstr "No writable runtime directory: both the temp folder and your user folder are unusable"

#: runner.error.thread_alive
msgctxt "runner.error.thread_alive"
msgid "动画线程尚未退出，请稍后再次停止。"
msgstr "The animation thread has not stopped yet; try stopping again in a moment."

#: card.hero.rank
msgctxt "card.hero.rank"
msgid "第 {rank} 名"
msgstr "#{rank}"

